# Copy to .env.local for development, and set the same in your host's build
# environment for production.

# Where contact form submissions are emailed. Get a key at web3forms.com — it
# is free and only asks you to verify the destination address.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ because the form posts from the browser. Web3Forms access keys
# are public by design: the key names the destination inbox, it does not grant
# access to anything.
#
# Inlined at BUILD time, so set it in the host's build settings and redeploy —
# adding it afterwards has no effect on an already-built site.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
